# Brewmie Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# '/' is the marketing landing page. The web app lives at /app/ and nowhere else:
# /app is normalised to /app/ (301); /app/ and /app/* serve the SPA shell with a 200
# rewrite. The shell keeps Vite's relative base ('./', needed by Capacitor and OTA), so
# at /app/ its relative URLs resolve under /app/ and the four static folders/files below
# are mapped back to their real root paths BEFORE the catch-all. Everything else falls
# through to real files (/privacy, /support, /.well-known/*, /ota/builds/*, ...) and any
# unknown path gets public/404.html with a real 404 status (there is deliberately NO
# '/* /index.html 200' rule).

/   /landing.html   200
/app   /app/   301
/app/assets/*   /assets/:splat   200
/app/fonts/*   /fonts/:splat   200
/app/translations/*   /translations/:splat   200
/app/manifest.json   /manifest.json   200
/app/*   /index.html   200
